recorded yet.", "Last {n} days: {days} days played, {sessions} sessions, {minutes} min", "Runs: {runs}", "none", "Best wave in that time: {w} (all-time timed {timed}, purge {purge})", "Deepest screen: {d}. Last screen before quit: {l}.", "{date}  sessions {s}  min {m}  runs {r}  best {b}  last {l}", "COPY PLAY SUMMARY", "Copies a short text summary of your recent play to the clipboard. It stays on this device unless you paste it somewhere.", "Copied. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you paste it.", "?", "THE FOUNDRY", "Permanent upgrades. Scrap upgrades reset when a deployment ends; Foundry levels stay.", "Paid in data from kills. It is banked when a deployment ends - even if Cinder falls.", "Each level raises your starting stats: every deployment begins stronger and reaches further.", "Tap a cost to buy. Hold to keep buying. Higher levels cost more until you reach further waves.", "DON'T SHOW THIS AGAIN", "GOT IT", "RECORD", "SERVICE RECORD", "BACK", "TRACKED SINCE {date}", "Started from your existing save: deployments and time played (last 30 days) carry over; best waves and Foundry totals are read from the save. Everything else counts from the date above.", "{n} deployment(s) are missing some totals (an update cut them short). Totals only add up deployments that were fully counted.", "Totals update when a deployment ends. Stored on this device only; RESET PROFILE clears them.", "GENERAL", "COMBAT", "MACHINES DESTROYED", "ECONOMY", "FRAMES", "TIME PLAYED", "TIME DEPLOYED", "DEPLOYMENTS", "{name} DEPLOYMENTS", "BEST WAVE {name}", "EARLIER DEPLOYMENTS", "WAVES CLEARED", "LONGEST DEPLOYMENT", "MACHINES DESTROYED", "BOSSES DESTROYED", "SHOTS FIRED", "CRITICAL HITS", "CRIT RATE", "DAMAGE DEALT", "HIGHEST SINGLE HIT", "HULL DAMAGE TAKEN", "SCRAP EARNED", "SCRAP SPENT", "UPGRADES BOUGHT", "DATA EARNED", "DATA SPENT IN FOUNDRY", "FOUNDRY LEVELS BOUGHT", "PATCHES PICKED", "{n} RUNS  BEST W{b}", "-")
